0:A great battle ensued between us, the Kingdom Jima, and the Shax Legion. Jima soldiers fought bravely, alas it was not enough to defeat the overwhelming force of the enemy. The result of the battle was grave; the Shax forces plundered and burned the eastern regions of the kingdom. They also captured the grand general Knarck.||Thy mission will not be simple. The goal is to recover the grand general with very limited resources at your disposal. Since the area he is held at is occupied by Shax forces, you won't be able to recruit skilled workforce to aid in your task. Thus, you will be forced to rely on local workers and mercenaries to achieve your goal.||Good luck commander!||[$0707FF]Difficulty Rating:[] ***||Map uses [$E1FA6B]Strangelove's[] improved AI script.|Map uses [$7A7AEB]Cmowla's[] Anti Lure script (4.3b). 
1:Our troops have descended into the ruins of what once was our local trade hub. Scouts have already started looking for the location of the imprisoned general. Use the few resources you have to rebuild the settlement and prepare for what is to come. 
2:The scouts have located the general. He is kept in the enemy fortress on the southeast from our position. They have also found out our citizens are kept as prisoners of war in other Shax camps. If we manage to free them, they will help us in our struggle against the enemy. 
3:The enemy fortress has fallen. Imprisoned villagers are now free and, on their way to join you to help you in your cause. 
4:Shax high command in the region has noticed our presence. We ought to prepare for any offensive actions they might carry out against us. 
5:Mercenary troops have been paid for and ready to fight! Make good use of them. 
6:[$b0c4de]Iron for mercenaries[]
7:We managed to free another group of villagers. We also established contact with mercenary group located in this realm. They offer to provide us with their troops in exchange for iron. It would be wise to make use of their offer.
